-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
lib/Adafruit_GFX/  -- Adafruit GFX Library v1.2.3 (BSD license, see
                      lib/Adafruit_GFX/license.txt)
                      Files vendored verbatim from the original repository
                      (Libraries/Adafruit_GFX_Library, upstream + STM32/Keil
                      portability patches that do not affect the class
                      contract).

The bit-rearrangement algorithm (framebuffer -> 384 bit anode chain, 43 scans
per frame) is derived from Libraries/VFD_GP1211AI/VFD_GP1211AI.cpp of the
original MIT licensed project; tests/reference_pack.* contains a 1:1
transcription of that original code and is used only as a comparison
reference.
